Z||000016||BC-GT||12-01-2001||06:48 PM||||When I looked at digital cameras awhile ago I ran into the same thing(looking at USA prices, but from Canada)Seemed to be no way around the Nikon warranty issues. On the other hand, Sony will honor there warranty anywhere, they call it a "goodwill warranty"<BR>Phoned Sony myself to verify, it was true. Made all the difference to me, got a Sony DSC-770 from the USA and I am very happy with it.<BR>PS. based on a purchase just over a year ago, cicumstances may have changed.<P>------------------<BR>Darryl Martin<BR>1985 GT <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.imagestation.com/picture/pf251a969c96964ef15691e97e7ac4489/feb64e3a.jpg.orig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
