Z||000021||Cliff Pennock||12-04-2001||06:17 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by baptistheart:<BR><B>Cliff you did report it to pricewatch right?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I did but Pricewatch will not do anything about it. I found out a lot of people had already reported it to pricewatch and still they are in their list. But, I also reported them to the BBB, BBBOnline, resellerratings.com and Nikon. Not that it will make any difference...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>For all the others offering to ship it to me: thanks, but I've already ordered it somewhere else for $650 (<B>before</B> rebate) and it's already under way (I'm tracking the package right now  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ). But thanks anyway! It'll be a few weeks before I get it though. My sister was thinking of getting one too so I have sent it to my sister first so she can play with it for a few weeks and decide if she'll get one too.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||14
